COMMON=("Flat 2D vector, uniform thick dark-brown outlines (#301f19), flat solid fills, NO gradients, NO drop shadows, NO text. "
"Character: Jesus Christ. Colors: robe off-white #fcfcfc with light-grey fold lines, royal-blue sash #475ef1, warm tan skin #d9a784 (face, hands, bare feet), "
"long wavy brown hair and full beard #a37a63, brown leather sandals #7a5646. Pure white background.")
HEAD="Cut-out puppet parts sheet for 2D character animation. "
GAPS=" Draw each part as a separate piece in ONE horizontal row, far apart with wide empty white gaps; no part touching, overlapping or cut off by the border. "
P={
'perfil':HEAD+"SIDE VIEW (profile) facing LEFT."+GAPS+"Parts: (1) head with long hair, beard and a short neck; (2) torso with robe skirt down to the knees and blue sash at the waist as ONE complete piece WITHOUT any arm, sleeve or hand - the shoulder and side area must be fully drawn robe; (3) full arm: sleeve from shoulder to wrist hanging straight down with blue cuff, no hand; (4) relaxed hand, side view, fingers slightly curled; (5) thigh: plain white robe-cloth tube; (6) lower leg and foot: bare tan shin with leather sandal pointing left. "+COMMON,
'frente':HEAD+"FRONT VIEW, standing facing the viewer, symmetrical."+GAPS+"Parts: (1) body: head with face, hair and beard, neck, torso and robe down to the ankles with sandaled feet visible, blue sash with hanging ends, ONE complete piece WITHOUT arms or sleeves (shoulders fully drawn); (2) upper arm: wide sleeve from shoulder to elbow; (3) forearm: sleeve from elbow to wrist with blue cuff, no hand. "+COMMON,
'costas':HEAD+"BACK VIEW (seen from behind), standing with back to the viewer."+GAPS+"Parts: (1) body: back of the head with long hair falling over the back, neck, back of torso and robe down to the ankles with sandaled heels visible, sash tied at the back, ONE complete piece WITHOUT arms or sleeves (shoulders fully drawn); (2) upper arm: wide sleeve from shoulder to elbow; (3) forearm: sleeve from elbow to wrist with blue cuff, no hand. "+COMMON,
'maos_frente':"Hand pose sheet for 2D animation: six versions of the SAME RIGHT HAND, palm facing the viewer, fingers pointing UP, short wrist at the bottom, arranged in one horizontal row with wide gaps, identical size and wrist position. 1) tightly closed fist; 2) fist with only the thumb extended; 3) thumb and index finger extended; 4) thumb, index and middle finger extended; 5) all fingers extended except the little finger still curled; 6) fully open hand, all five fingers extended and slightly spread. "+COMMON,
'maos_costas':"Hand pose sheet for 2D animation: six versions of the SAME LEFT HAND seen from BEHIND (back of the hand and knuckles facing the viewer), fingers pointing UP, short wrist at the bottom, arranged in one horizontal row with wide gaps, identical size and wrist position. 1) tightly closed fist; 2) fist with only the thumb extended; 3) thumb and index finger extended; 4) thumb, index and middle finger extended; 5) all fingers extended except the little finger still curled; 6) fully open hand, all five fingers extended and slightly spread. "+COMMON,
}
P['costas2']=HEAD+"BACK VIEW (seen from behind)."+" Draw THREE separate small pieces in ONE horizontal row, each fully inside the image with at least 100px empty margin on all sides, far apart, never touching or cut off. Pieces: (1) the HEAD seen from behind: only long wavy brown hair covering the back of the head, with ears hidden, short neck; (2) the BODY seen from behind: shoulders, back, robe down to the ankles, blue sash tied in a bow at the back, two sandaled heels at the bottom, NO head and NO arms and NO sleeves (shoulders fully drawn as plain robe); (3) one ARM: wide white sleeve from shoulder to wrist with blue cuff, bare tan forearm stub at the end, NO hand. "+COMMON
BR=" Single piece only, centered, fully inside the image with a wide white margin. ONE arm in a raised greeting pose seen in the stated view: the upper arm goes outward to the LEFT side of the image and slightly down from the shoulder, elbow bent about 90 degrees, forearm pointing straight UP; wide white sleeve with a blue cuff at the wrist, a short bare tan forearm stub emerging from the cuff, NO hand, NO fingers, NO body. "
P['braco_frente']="Cut-out puppet piece for 2D animation. FRONT VIEW of an arm."+BR+COMMON
P['braco_costas']="Cut-out puppet piece for 2D animation. BACK VIEW (seen from behind) of an arm."+BR+COMMON
